Really?

82
00:06:45,690 --> 00:06:50,650
There are a bunch of stories in there,
so hopefully you'll find one you like.

83
00:06:50,650 --> 00:06:52,600
Wow, thanks!

84
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,480
That'll be a fun read, Remi.

85
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,060
Yeah!

86
00:07:00,150 --> 00:07:02,650
Oh, do you like books like these, too, Kono- <i>san</i> ?

87
00:07:02,650 --> 00:07:05,350
Wait, me? Yeah.

88
00:07:05,350 --> 00:07:08,730
Then you can borrow them after Ayasaki- <i>san</i> .

89
00:07:08,730 --> 00:07:12,600
I really like the third story in
the collection. It's really captivating.

90
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,440
Wait, are you sure?

91
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,060
Yeah.

92
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:17,520
Th-Thanks.

93
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:19,440
You're welcome.

94
00:07:21,850 --> 00:07:26,440
I really liked these. Thanks!

95
00:07:26,440 --> 00:07:27,690
Then here, read these next.

96
00:07:27,690 --> 00:07:31,350
Whoa, more books?! Sweet!

97
00:07:31,350 --> 00:07:32,850
How many books do you own?

98
00:07:32,850 --> 00:07:37,810
They're mostly my parents'. We have
a whole room full of them at my house.

99
00:07:37,810 --> 00:07:40,770
Really? I wish I could see.

100
00:07:40,770 --> 00:07:44,020
You want to? You can.

101
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:47,230
Oh, don't worry; I won't be
weird about it or anything!

102
00:07:47,230 --> 00:07:50,770
Oh, uh, sure, got it.

103
00:07:53,410 --> 00:07:55,410
Sengoku

104
00:07:53,850 --> 00:07:58,310
Wow, you really <i>do</i> have a whole roomful!

105
00:07:58,310 --> 00:08:02,230
We haven't cleaned in here much,
so watch out for the dust.

106
00:08:03,850 --> 00:08:05,230
Are you okay?!

107
00:08:05,230 --> 00:08:09,020
I'm fine! I shouldn't have
touched without asking.

108
00:08:09,020 --> 00:08:11,810
I just wanted to see this one book.

109
00:08:11,810 --> 00:08:14,100
Oh, that one's really old.

110
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:15,770
What's it about?

111
00:08:15,770 --> 00:08:19,900
The day before the world ends, I think?

112
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:23,060
Is it the whole world,
or just Japan that gets destroyed?

113
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:26,480
Think it's the whole world.
Everyone goes into a panic.

114
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,980
If you knew the world was going to end tomorrow,

115
00:08:28,980 --> 00:08:31,810
you probably wouldn't feel like
doing much of anything, huh?

116
00:08:31,810 --> 00:08:35,270
You think so? I'd wanna
blow through all my money.

117
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:36,940
And I'd load up on desserts, too.

118
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:40,900
Huh? You're spending your
last day on Earth eating dessert?!

119
00:08:40,900 --> 00:08:44,440
There are tons I've never tried! Might as well!

120
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:47,150
I see.

121
00:08:47,150 --> 00:08:50,980
Are your pigtails up higher today?

122
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:55,150
Y-Yeah, I just felt like it.

123
00:08:55,150 --> 00:08:57,190
I like it. It looks nice!

124
00:08:57,190 --> 00:08:59,190
Really?!

125
00:09:05,350 --> 00:09:08,980
If you're cute, you can do
whatever, you'll still be cute!

126
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:12,480
Guess you don't understand where
I'm coming from, though, Sengoku- <i>kun</i> .

127
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:15,770
Sorry to interrupt! Can I borrow you?

128
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:20,020
Thanks for lending these to me! I read 'em all.

129
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:22,020
You didn't have to rush through them.

130
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:25,600
I didn't! They were so good,
I ended up on a reading binge.

131
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:29,270
Man, though, I really wouldn't
want the world to end tomorrow!

132
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:31,150
What about all those desserts, though?

133
00:09:31,150 --> 00:09:34,730
The end of the world is no time for desserts!

134
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:43,600
Kamioka has a crush on you, Ayasaki- <i>san</i> .

135
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,730
Mmkay.

136
00:09:45,730 --> 00:09:49,770
Hey, can I go over to your
place again today, Sengoku- <i>kun</i> ?

137
00:09:50,810 --> 00:09:51,940
Sure.

138
00:09:51,940 --> 00:09:57,270
Just, I know you're used
to talking to guys, Ayasaki- <i>san</i> ,

139
00:09:57,270 --> 00:10:01,060
but I might get the wrong
idea about your intentions.

140
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:09,270
You'll like this series, Ayasaki- <i>san</i> .
It's long, but totally worth the read.

141
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:13,150
Can't wait to read it, then.

142
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:18,770
Hey, Sengoku- <i>kun</i> ?

143
00:10:18,770 --> 00:10:23,690
So, Sengoku- <i>kun</i> , I, uh...

144
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:25,810
What is it?

145
00:10:25,810 --> 00:10:30,150
Nothing, just, uh, what if--

146
00:10:30,150 --> 00:10:35,150
What if the world was gonna end
tomorrow? What would you do?

147
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:38,940
Huh? Oh, you mean like that book?

148
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:42,810
I mean, kind of, but... sure.

149
00:10:42,810 --> 00:10:45,350
I'd tell you I liked you.

150
00:10:47,730 --> 00:10:50,810
Then I'd turn to space dust.

151
00:10:50,810 --> 00:10:52,730
The end.

152
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:59,690
Was that a joke?

153
00:10:59,690 --> 00:11:01,310
No.

154
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:04,940
It wasn't.

155
00:11:07,020 --> 00:11:09,400
Never mind, just forget it!

156
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:14,560
Why're you so embarrassed?

157
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:17,480
I-I am <i>not</i> embarrassed!

158
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:19,310
C'mon, don't lie.

159
00:11:19,310 --> 00:11:22,480
I'm not lying! I'm not embarrassed at all!

160
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:26,230
I know you are. Your face is all red!

161
00:11:26,230 --> 00:11:28,020
I'm glad.

162
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:29,520
Yeah, sure.

163
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:31,350
You know,

164
00:11:31,350 --> 00:11:35,270
I like you, too, Sengoku- <i>kun</i> !

165
