194
00:11:51,350 --> 00:11:54,730
I finished studying early,
so I had some extra time.

195
00:11:54,730 --> 00:12:00,230
Oh, cool. What'd you think
of this bestselling tearjerker?

196
00:12:00,230 --> 00:12:02,730
It was okay.

197
00:12:02,730 --> 00:12:04,980
He's lying.

198
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:07,900
He cried while reading it last night.

199
00:12:07,900 --> 00:12:12,650
When we met, he didn't get swept away
by those around him. I loved him then.

200
00:12:12,650 --> 00:12:13,900
And I love who he is now, too.

201
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:20,190
His weak points, the fact that
he can't lie, how hard he tries--

202
00:12:20,190 --> 00:12:22,850
I love all of him.

203
00:12:24,650 --> 00:12:27,440
So... why the sudden urge to give me a manicure?

204
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:31,020
Well, I was cleaning my room
and found some unopened bottles.

205
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:34,900
I thought this color'd look good on you.

206
00:12:34,900 --> 00:12:36,690
Okay.

207
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:41,270
O-Oh, no.

208
00:12:41,270 --> 00:12:43,400
I shouldn't, but I want to.

209
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,980
She'd be so mad.

210
00:12:44,980 --> 00:12:47,440
Miyamura, other foot!

211
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,350
But...

212
00:12:49,350 --> 00:12:50,690
Miyamura?

213
00:12:50,690 --> 00:12:52,270
Gimme your other foot, c'mon--

214
00:12:52,410 --> 00:12:53,660
PLOP

215
00:13:02,730 --> 00:13:05,310
I thought if I stepped on you...

216
00:13:05,310 --> 00:13:09,560
I'd get enough EXP to level up.

217
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,230
What?

218
00:13:11,230 --> 00:13:12,270
I'm kidding! I'm so sorry!

219
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:15,560
You're always messing with me,
so I figured I'd try messing with you today!

220
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:16,850
I'm sorry! I'm really sorry!

221
00:13:16,850 --> 00:13:20,770
It's okay, I'm not, like, mad.
I'm just kind of surprised.

222
00:13:20,770 --> 00:13:25,980
Plus, like, you're always going off
on Shindo- <i>kun</i> and Sawada- <i>san</i> ,

223
00:13:25,980 --> 00:13:28,100
but when you're with me,
you're so calm and well-mannered,

224
00:13:28,100 --> 00:13:31,850
so are you, like, faking it for me?
Is this not you?

225
00:13:31,850 --> 00:13:35,400
No, this is the real me, I promise.

226
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,690
Oh.

227
00:13:36,690 --> 00:13:41,480
I mean, would you rather
I yelled at you and hit you instead?

228
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,690
No, definitely--

229
00:13:44,690 --> 00:13:47,150
Goddamn. C'mon, Kyoko!

230
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:50,060
Who the hell d'ya think
you're talking to, bitch?!

231
00:13:50,060 --> 00:13:51,690
Actually, that's kind of hot.

232
00:13:51,690 --> 00:13:53,060
What?!

233
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,940
Mornin', Miyamura.

234
00:13:56,940 --> 00:14:00,600
Hey. How's it hangin', Ishikawa?

235
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,600
Fine.

236
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:06,190
Damn, dude,

237
00:14:06,190 --> 00:14:10,060
you still listening to this, Iura?
I mean, it's all bangers, but damn.

238
00:14:10,060 --> 00:14:10,600
Dude.

239
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,350
I have no idea, man!

240
00:14:12,350 --> 00:14:16,310
Oh, Miyamura- <i>kun</i> . Could I please
borrow your Math B textbook?

241
00:14:16,310 --> 00:14:21,230
Man, seriously, Prez? You forgot yours?
Get your shit together, man!

242
00:14:21,230 --> 00:14:22,650
Ishikawa- <i>kun</i> !

243
00:14:22,650 --> 00:14:25,020
Don't look at me! I got no clue what's going on!

244
00:14:25,020 --> 00:14:26,900
What's up with you today, Miyamura?

245
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:29,090
Gloom

246
00:14:26,900 --> 00:14:27,770
Kill me.

247
00:14:27,770 --> 00:14:29,350
Huh?

248
00:14:29,350 --> 00:14:32,440
I'm guessing this is something Her Highness
the Ice Queen wanted you to do.

249
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:33,270
Yep.

250
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:35,980
If you don't want to do this,
then you should tell her.

251
00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:37,230
Morning!

252
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:39,900
I'm begging you, Ishikawa- <i>kun</i> , get it together!

253
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:41,850
Stop making this my problem!

254
00:14:41,850 --> 00:14:44,560
Wow, it was that tough?

255
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:47,650
Guess I'll never get to see you
get all violent with me, then.

256
00:14:47,650 --> 00:14:51,730
Well, I'll just wait for you
to forget, then give it a try.

257
